*.log
logs/

# --- Claude Code config (SCRUM-83) ---
# CLAUDE.md, the shared settings.json and the skills are tracked; everything
# else under .claude/ (notably settings.local.json, which is machine-specific
# and may hold secrets) stays local. `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/`: git
# can't re-include files inside a directory that is itself ignored.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
